@startuml
!include style.iuml
' UC-12 View Reports and Audit Log (M12). Built from activity_report and activity_audit.
' Code: ReportsPage -> AnalyticsController (summary PDF, ExamAccessService owner check; download re-checks) and
' ReportExportService (attendance / violations / scores PDF, Excel, evidence ZIP; REPORT_GENERATED with SHA-256);
' AuditLogsPage (Admin, SuperAdmin) -> AuditController getLogs (latest 200) + verify (hash chain: valid, broken at
' #n, or unsealed rows; "Seal legacy entries" backfill).
' Plain labels: endpoints, status codes, file details and the backfill step are left out.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 25
}

|Teacher or Admin|
|Server|
|Admin|
|Teacher or Admin|
start
:Pick an exam and a
report: summary PDF,
attendance, violations,
scores, Excel or
evidence ZIP;
|Server|
if (Owner of the exam\nor admin?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes])
  :Build the file
  and save it;
  :Log exports (not the
  summary PDF) with the
  file's SHA-256 hash;
endif
|Teacher or Admin|
:Download
the file;
stop
|Admin|
start
:Open the
audit log;
|Server|
:Load the latest
200 entries, verify
the hash chain;
|Admin|
:Filter the entries,
see "verified" or
where the chain
breaks;
stop
@enduml
